    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109215" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποστένω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>moan in a low tone,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				79
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποστένοι μέντἂν ὁ . . λεώς</span>”
				<i>would grumble,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					162
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Charito
				6.2
			</span></i>; 
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποστεναχίζω</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1086.45
			</span></i>.</div>
